{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Wonderland M&quot; Annual Expansion \u2014 &quot;Olympus&quot;: The Descent of Divine Punishment!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highlights of this massive update:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25ceNew Companion: The player-designed partner &quot;Iris&quot; has arrived to face the might of Olympus!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1481340/extras/022b0891ffd023e67623f5c4a4ad7b31.avif?t=1766026890\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25ceNew Challenges: Uncover the &quot;Source of Chaos&quot; in the new storyline and survive the &quot;Wrath of the Gods&quot; in the new dungeon!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1481340/extras/07ef99049145d7aba331609c97933d0d.avif?t=1766026890\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25ceNew Feature: The &quot;Wonderland Temple - Star Corridor&quot; system is coming soon\u2014the perfect place to house your Reincarnated Partners!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1481340/extras/4e5fd0ea3b798773c8608702b8c4fff5.avif?t=1766026890\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25ce&quot;Wonderland M&quot; New Expansion \u2013 Floating Monkey\u2019s Grand Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1481340/extras/597631f1f3421a2aa76ee1ed8bb42ada.avif?t=1766026890\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adorable Floating Monkey debut, with exclusive dungeons, furniture, and mounts!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25ce\u300cVenus and Athena\u300dDual Goddess Rebirth Arrival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1481340/extras/6b2ce385880e97a055cb4049ea558e3f.avif?t=1766026890\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The brand-new expansion of &quot;Wonderland M - Goddess Rebirth,&quot; is officially here!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The final storyline and the second part of the reincarnation quests for &quot;Venus&quot; and &quot;Athena&quot; are now fully available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25ceNew Dark Attribute Character - Dragon Betrayer Arrives</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1481340/extras/4620c3382981f0e654d4ccd0f89bb1f7.avif?t=1766026890\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The forbidden power of the Hopeless Black Dragon Nidhogg, they abandoned the innate defense of the dragon race in exchange for immense evil power and forbidden magic. As followers of Nidhogg, the Dragon Betrayers inherit his dark legacy, and both enemies and allies fear their power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the power of despair bestowed upon the Dragon Betrayers by the Hopeless Black Dragon Nidhogg, they can use Dark Attribute skills. Destroying all creatures, sacrificing defense for high attack, they seem to have an innate suppression effect on all living beings.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25ceNew Goddess Creation Quest, New Goddess Event CG Story!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1481340/extras/56320103c8557cb32bc8645a30b4ff6a.avif?t=1766026890\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the game update, when creating a new character, you can choose the new &quot;Goddess Creation&quot; quest and go to the Raphael Battleship commanded by Captain &quot;Catherine&quot; to begin the Goddess story line. During your adventure, you will encounter classic characters from &quot;Goddess Online&quot; and trigger beautiful Japanese-voiced CG stories.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25ceMeet Companions Who Cheat Death! Unravel Vast and Interesting Stories!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1481340/extras/4c82784a71319387c1b95b444ca7323b.poster.avif?t=1766026890\" width=600 height=462 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1481340/extras/4c82784a71319387c1b95b444ca7323b.webm?t=1766026890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1481340/extras/4c82784a71319387c1b95b444ca7323b.mp4?t=1766026890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter &quot;Niss&quot; who just woke up under a tree, rescue the grandmother and granddaughter &quot;Xiao Lan&quot; whose home was invaded by bandits, befriend the brave and adventurous village chief's daughter &quot;Loka&quot;, and meet different companions to unlock one interesting and funny story after another.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25ceDesign Your Unique Home!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1481340/extras/b97007e86ca89eea4ae93d058072adbd.poster.avif?t=1766026890\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1481340/extras/b97007e86ca89eea4ae93d058072adbd.webm?t=1766026890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1481340/extras/b97007e86ca89eea4ae93d058072adbd.mp4?t=1766026890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Housing is one of the most popular systems in the game. In the game, players can transform their initial tiny &quot;shack&quot; into their own &quot;mansion&quot; or &quot;Dream House&quot; through a wide variety of tent styles and furniture arrangements. The official team will also periodically hold housing design events, selecting outstanding works and awarding rich prizes!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25ceCapture All Companion Pets! Even Beauties and Beasts Can Be Ridden!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1481340/extras/77a922070c5f898f7a6bfa47bf73e0a5.poster.avif?t=1766026890\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1481340/extras/77a922070c5f898f7a6bfa47bf73e0a5.webm?t=1766026890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;What!? You can ride beauties and beasts!? Am I seeing things?&quot; No need to be surprised, because this is Phasmophobia! In the game, almost all creatures encountered in the wild can be captured. The most interesting part is that all captured pets can become mounts, whether they walk on land, fly in the sky, have human forms, or are animals, everyone can ride them!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Transportation to Travel the World! Land, Sea, and Air All Included!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1481340/extras/04d4da76a2f6a671355b2d55a6cbc305.poster.avif?t=1766026890\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1481340/extras/04d4da76a2f6a671355b2d55a6cbc305.webm?t=1766026890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1481340/extras/04d4da76a2f6a671355b2d55a6cbc305.mp4?t=1766026890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the Open Drifting World! Travel to Kyoto, Egypt, Persia, Rome, and more!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1481340/extras/83d7a612943f55812a69f3fc18142a2e.poster.avif?t=1766026890\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1481340/extras/83d7a612943f55812a69f3fc18142a2e.webm?t=1766026890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1481340/extras/83d7a612943f55812a69f3fc18142a2e.mp4?t=1766026890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most players must have dreamed of traveling the world, but alas, time is not enough, and this goal can only slowly become a fantasy. However, in the game, players will have the opportunity to drive different modes of transportation and personally experience locations across the globe from ancient to modern times, including &quot;Asia, Europe, Antarctica, and even Mayan civilizations&quot;!!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1481340?t=1766026890","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1481340/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766026890","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1481340/03101eba64c8